  "id": "formal-thought-disorder",
  "term": "formal thought disorder",
  "definition": "Formal thought disorder is a disturbance in how thoughts are organized and flow, rather than what the thoughts are about. It is assessed by examining the timing and logical structure of a person’s stream of thought, and it can markedly interfere with communication.",
